+      <p>You will no longer be able to sign in to The Daily Grind with <strong id="delete-name"></strong>. It will also be removed from your password manager where supported.</p>
+      <p id="delete-last-warning" hidden><strong>This is your last passkey.</strong> Make sure you can still sign in with your password.</p>
